<article class="article-hero" style="padding-bottom:0;">
  <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); margin-top:20px;">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
  <p class="article-meta">Last updated September 2026</p>
</article>

<div class="article-body">
  <p>Mimajo is reader-supported. When you book through some of the links on this site, we may earn a commission from the airline, hotel, OTA, or travel partner — at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>. Your price stays the same whether you click our link or go to the merchant directly.</p>

  <h2>Where this applies</h2>
  <p>Affiliate links may appear on our Deals, Flash, and Magazine pages, including "Book Now" buttons and links embedded within articles. Not every link on Mimajo is an affiliate link, but many are.</p>

  <h2>How this affects what we publish</h2>
  <p>Deals are selected and ranked by price, value, and how recently we've verified them — not by which merchant pays the highest commission. If a better deal exists with a partner we don't have an affiliate relationship with, we'll still tell you about it.</p>

  <h2>Our affiliate partners</h2>
  <p>We work with travel affiliate networks and programmes including, but not limited to, Agoda, Booking.com, Trip.com, Klook, Skyscanner, and aggregators such as Travelpayouts. This list will grow as we add new partners; we don't maintain a separate real-time list on this page.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about a specific link or partnership, reach out via our <a href="/enquiry.html">enquiry form</a>.</p>
</div>
